{
  "name": "contiRoundMenu",
  "comment": "OpenSWOS's view of one round of a continental cup (the Mod 4.1 shows it in the game's own cup screens; ours is one screen): a knockout round's ties with each leg's score, the club through highlighted; a group stage's tables and results; its SUMMARY page. 13 lines a page, the scroll arrows for the rest; PREV / NEXT ROUND the cup's other rounds. JSON-only; handlers in src/conti_view.c.",
